From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:23:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] OverlayRenderer: draw SDR PGS at the video's SDR white

With the GUI composited instead of converted by the kernel, an SDR PGS
is drawn at the GUI peak, not at the SDR white of the video under it.
Under sdr2hdr it is then several times dimmer than the picture.
