 .../VideoRenderers/OverlayRendererUtil.cpp    | 51 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../VideoRenderers/OverlayRendererUtil.h      | 10 ++++
 .../VideoRenderers/RenderManager.cpp          |  3 ++
 7 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

